From cd13886a3b5e3145115a1f24793dc6a330e57430 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cryolitia PukNgae <cryolitia@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 07:14:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(camera): expose physical SOF and EOF frame timestamps

Cross-stamp the SM8750 CSID980 physical counter against CLOCK_MONOTONIC
and associate IPP/RDI0 SOF and EOF with the existing two-buffer VFE FIFO.
Publish the actual SOF through standard FRAME_SYNC events and retain the
physical EOF in DQBUF timestamps. Add a timestamped media-event helper
while preserving the queue-time behavior of every existing caller.

Reject discontinuous markers, invalid cross-stamps and receiver errors
through standard V4L2 error buffers until the stream restarts. CSI SOF
keeps its frame-start meaning; it is not labelled exposure start.
---
